{"id":"03660f06e766acab","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/818_SMTL.md","title":"818 SMTL","display":"818_SMTL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。SMTL 使用构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot,\\quad \\&amp;,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot,\\quad \\&amp;,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\quad \\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{fus},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\quad \\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{fus},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{meet},\\operatorname{join}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}^2\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生否定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\">\\(\\neg A:=A\\to\\bot\\)</span>。无项、量词或绑定变量。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足：</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span>，则分别有</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-变元出现与替换\">3. 变元出现与替换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A)=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\sigma,A)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(A)=\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\sigma,A)\\)</span>。其子句为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\\operatorname{fus}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{fus}(A,B))=\\operatorname{fus}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{meet}(A,B))=\\operatorname{meet}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{join}(A,B))=\\operatorname{join}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定排除条款：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{SMTL}}B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nA=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{SMTL}}B\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nA=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由变元函数别名与替换函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(A,\\sigma)=\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\qquad\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\qquad\n\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此本语言不需要 fresh 名称、捕获避免重命名或绑定变量替换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma\\)</span> 是该命题语言的全部结构作用。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-SMTL-代数结构\">4. SMTL-代数结构</h1>\n<p>SMTL-代数为元组：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf S=(S,\\le,0,1,*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf S=(S,\\le,0,1,*,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足下列 MTL 型结构条件。\n其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad \\le\\ \\subseteq S^2,\\quad 0,1\\in S,\n\\quad *,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee:S^2\\to S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad \\le\\ \\subseteq S^2,\\quad 0,1\\in S,\n\\quad *,\\Rightarrow,\\wedge,\\vee:S^2\\to S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些条件展开为下列等式和序条件。对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in S\">\\(a,b,c\\in S\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge a=a,\\quad a\\vee a=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\quad a\\vee b=b\\vee a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a,\\quad a\\vee b=b\\vee a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\quad\n(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c),\\quad\n(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a,\\quad a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\le a,\\quad a\\le1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\le a,\\quad a\\le1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee b=b,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le b\\Longleftrightarrow a\\wedge b=a\n\\Longleftrightarrow a\\vee b=b,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a*b=b*a,\\quad (a*b)*c=a*(b*c),\\quad a*1=a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a*b=b*a,\\quad (a*b)*c=a*(b*c),\\quad a*1=a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>剩余条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a*b\\le c\\Leftrightarrow a\\le b\\Rightarrow c,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a*b\\le c\\Leftrightarrow a\\le b\\Rightarrow c,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及预线性</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(a\\Rightarrow b)\\vee(b\\Rightarrow a)=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(a\\Rightarrow b)\\vee(b\\Rightarrow a)=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>另加严格性条件：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a*b=0\\Rightarrow a=0\\text{ 或 }b=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a*b=0\\Rightarrow a=0\\text{ 或 }b=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标差异是 SMTL 排除非零零因子；这比 MTL 严格，比 IMTL 的对合条件不同。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-赋值递归\">5. 赋值递归</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span> 为所有 SMTL-代数之类。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf S\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\mathbf S\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to S\">\\(v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to S\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=v(p),\n\\quad\n\\llbracket\\operatorname{bot}\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=v(p),\n\\quad\n\\llbracket\\operatorname{bot}\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}*\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{fus}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}*\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\wedge\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{meet}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\wedge\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\vee\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{join}(A,B)\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\vee\n\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-语义有效集合与后承\">6. 语义有效集合与后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}:\n\\forall\\mathbf S\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\,\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to S\\,\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}:\n\\forall\\mathbf S\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\,\n\\forall v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to S\\,\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义主后承关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\models_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\models_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}A\\)</span> 当且仅当对所有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf S\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\mathbf S\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to S\">\\(v:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to S\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=1\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=1\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-反例证书\">7. 反例证书</h1>\n<p>反例证书类为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\mathbf S,v):\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\\n\\mathbf S\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\\nv:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to S,\\\n\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=1,\\\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\ne1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\n\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\mathbf S,v):\n\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\\n\\mathbf S\\in\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\\\nv:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to S,\\\n\\forall C\\in\\Gamma\\,\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=1,\\\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{\\mathbf S,v}^{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\ne1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\{(\\mathbf S,v):(\\Gamma,A,\\mathbf S,v)\\in\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\\{(\\mathbf S,v):(\\Gamma,A,\\mathbf S,v)\\in\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式证明规则关系声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\qquad \\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\qquad \\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该条目不定义非空证明对象。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>SMTL 形式系统为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Cex}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span>、语义有效集合与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathsf{SMTL}}\\)</span> 均由本文件的 SMTL-代数载体、严格性方程、赋值递归和反例证书定义；不引用外部公式类、命名基逻辑或外部公理表。</p>\n<p>该系统只含命题句法、命题替换、严格 MTL-代数、语义有效集合和后承关系；不含对合条件、BL 可除性条件或证明论对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-变元出现与替换","text":"3. 变元出现与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-SMTL-代数结构","text":"4. SMTL-代数结构","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值递归","text":"5. 赋值递归","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义有效集合与后承","text":"6. 语义有效集合与后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-反例证书","text":"7. 反例证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot,\\quad \\&,\\quad \\to,\\quad \\wedge,\\quad \\vee.","display":true},{